WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:05.680
<i>My name is Kelvin. I don't know
what happened in my last life,</i>

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:10.030
<i>but I've been reborn into another
world as an adventurer.</i>

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:15.710
<i>The goddess of reincarnation, Melfina,
has been looking out for me here.</i>

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:19.810
<i>She says that in my last
life, I was kind of crazy.</i>

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.010
<i>I sacrificed my memories
for skills in this life.</i>

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:28.030
<i>Clotho and I spent our days taking
jobs from the guild and leveling up.</i>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.660
<i>Thanks to my Double Skill Points
and Double Growth Rate skills,</i>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.670
<b>Double Skill Points
Double Growth Rate
Experience Sharing</b>

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:37.340
<i>I got a ton of bonuses upon leveling
up, and 100 skill points!</i>

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:42.150
<i>I took Concealment (Rank D)
from the huge list of skills.</i>

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.140
<b>Assist Effects
Concealment (Rank D)</b>

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.910
<i>I was reincarnated from another world,
and had a ton of rare skills.</i>

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.120
<i>In order to be able to live a peaceful life,</i>

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.660
<i>I want to level up to
Concealment (Rank B) soon.</i>

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:57.370
<i>Leveling up also gave Clotho
the Absorb (Rank F) skill!</i>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:58.030
<b>Name: Clotho
Level: 2 Title: None
HP: 105/105
MP:100/100
Skills:                    Skills:
Absorb (Rank F) Absorb (Rank F)
Blunt Resist          Blunt Resist</b>

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.210
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:33.180
Kelvin, congratulations!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:38.390
With this job, you've been
promoted to Rank E adventurer!

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:40.720
Thanks.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.850
To be honest, when you started taking
higher-ranking jobs without forming a party,

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.070
I was worried.

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:52.430
<i>It wasn't that you didn't
form a party. You couldn't!</i>

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.840
<i>If I did, they'd find out instantly
that I was a summoner.</i>

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:00.820
<i>And I've got a strong partner, Clotho.
I don't need one.</i>

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:06.360
<i>Weren't you planning on not
standing out, My Lord?</i>

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.600
He's already been promoted?

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:14.380
He's the new kid who just
registered as a Rank F, right?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.870
And he's going solo? Really?

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:21.880
Maybe some mage screwed up at his job
and had to become an adventurer.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.340
Kelvin!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:29.350
Are you a court mage from
some palace somewhere?

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.060
You're too strong for a beginner!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.710
Um... I can't say much about my past.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:36.770
Sorry.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:40.050
No, I shouldn't be asking!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:44.110
You're not supposed to ask
adventurers things like that.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:46.900
But do be careful!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:51.040
Knowing you, you're going after
a Rank D job next, right?

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.760
Yes, I am.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.920
Don't worry.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.090
If I think it's dangerous,
I'll turn tail and run.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.090
I'm a fast runner, you know!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:02.590
At least get better gear!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:07.500
Your equipment's the same
as it was a week ago!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.320
Okay.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.280
I'll get new equipment.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.670
So please give me a Rank D job.

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:19.380
If you want a Rank D job, why not
take down a Blackghost Knight?

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.600
A Blackghost Knight?

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.810
Cashel!

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.710
You're back?

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:27.530
Hey, Ange. I'm back indeed.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.040
I just got in.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.540
Welcome back.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.310
How'd the job go?

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.590
Finished just fine, of course.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:40.040
The Lizardman nest was a bit of a challenge.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.610
But well, it was a Rank C job.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.360
By the way, you there.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.860
You just got promoted to Rank E, right?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.650
As a more experienced adventurer,
I'm happy for you!

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:55.910
Um, and you are?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.520
I hadn't introduced myself, have I?

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.160
I'm Cashel, a Rank D adventurer.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:07.530
Liar. He's actually as strong as a Rank B.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.740
He loves crushing the new kids.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:15.090
He's going after the cocky new kid who's
taking jobs above his rank, right?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.710
Nobody in the guild's
stronger than him, either.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.500
Shouldn't somebody tell the mage?

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:34.810
My party's going after a Blackghost Knight.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.420
Want to join us?

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:37.880
W-Wait!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.360
Yes, it's a Rank D job,

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:45.130
but that Blackghost Knight is reported
to be stronger than others!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.870
It's too dangerous for Kelvin!
He just got promoted to Rank E!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.200
It's fine, Ange.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.520
We'll help him, and he'll be fine.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.970
Well...

00:05:56.430 --> 00:06:00.000
I appreciate the offer,
but I won't join your party.

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:04.060
Somebody as weak as me
couldn't possibly help you.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.100
Don't be humble.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:17.350
<b>Name: Cashel
Level: 34 Title: Murderer
HP 315/315
MP 104/104
Age: 25 | Strength 156
Race: Human | Endurance 131
Sex: Male | Agility 126
Class: Magic Swordsman | Magic 102
Luck 89</b>

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:17.350
<b>Skills:
Swordsmanship (Rank B)
Strength (Rank E)
White Magic (Rank E)
Stealth (Rank E)
Concealment (Rank F)
Persuasion (Rank E)
Assist Effects:
Concealment (Rank F)</b>

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:13.370
<i>His stats are as high as Clotho's.</i>

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.330
<i>He has some worrisome skills, too.</i>

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.340
<i>But his title's what I really don't like.</i>

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.350
<b>Name:     Cashel</b>

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.350
<b>Level:               34             Title:          Murderer</b>

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.340
<i>"Murderer"?</i>

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:22.830
<i>But he's not going to back down...</i>

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.580
<i>I know what to do.</i>

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:28.770
Why don't we compete, then?

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.990
Compete?

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:35.570
Yes, let's compete to see who can defeat
this Blackghost Knight monster first.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.570
Of course, I'll go solo.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:43.440
Listen, you can't beat that thing solo,
no matter how strong you are.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:47.560
I'll be going with a party,
as I planned. Is that okay?

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:48.680
Sure.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.670
You're quite confident.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.740
I'm fine with that.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.420
<i>I'll deliberately walk into his trap.</i>

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:07.650
<i>He'll come after me when I'm fighting the
Blackghost Knight, I think, or after.</i>

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.900
<i>I'm curious about his party, too.</i>

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.270
<i>Well, they'll make good opponents to fight.</i>

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.010
Carol, don't push me!

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:18.030
Tell him that Cashel's bad news!

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.990
<i>You sure about this, My Lord?</i>

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.210
I want to show off what I've gained
from my leveling and training.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:21.570
He's mumbling to himself!
I'm scared of him!

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:26.090
<i>My Lord, you're making it sound like
we're the ones who set a trap for him.</i>

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.280
Quiet!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.300
Sorry!

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.070
Kelvin, be careful!

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.060
Good luck!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:33.560
I'll be quiet!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.550
So, what're we looking at?

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:46.050
Oh, Boss. That rookie might be
tougher than we thought.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.390
My Appraising Eye is Rank C.

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:52.500
Which means he's got Rank
C Concealment, at least.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.960
I thought he was a reckless
idiot who wanted to show off.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:00.460
But your Appraising Eye
can't read his status.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:02.510
So maybe he's hiding something?

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:03.930
Hey, Cashel.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.320
I get to hurt him like
I did last time, right?

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.320
Let me fight first!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:10.790
Raj, calm down.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:14.030
He offered us a friendly competition.

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:18.250
As veterans, we need to appreciate
the new kid for being brave.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.750
Call it on-the-job training.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.850
Raj, don't just crush him, okay?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.680
Gotta be gentle!

00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:28.770
Sorry, too complicated for me!

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.230
I'll just do it like I always do!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:36.840
I hope you'll entertain me, Rookie.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:42.250
<b>Name: Cashel
Level: 34 Title: Murderer
HP 315/315
MP 104/104
Age: 25 | Strength 156
Race: Human | Endurance 131
Sex: Male | Agility 126
Class: Magic Swordsman | Magic 102
Luck 89
Skills:
Swordsmanship (Rank B) | Strength (Rank E)
White Magic (Rank E) | Stealth (Rank E)
Concealment (Rank F) | Persuasion (Rank E)
Assist Effects:
Concealment (Rank F)</b>

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:42.250
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.170
<b>Wicked
Spirits'
Castle</b>

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:57.130
What?

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:01.790
All the undead monsters are already defeated?

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.810
Oh, you're here, Cashel!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.310
And that must be your party!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.730
<i>A verdant staff? So he's a green mage?</i>

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:14.900
<i>He's an idiot.</i>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.740
<b>Verdant Staff (Bonuses for Green Magic)</b>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:19.740
<i>He can conceal his stats, but his equipment
tells us all we need to know.</i>

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:24.570
I think the Blackghost Knight is
on the other side of this door!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.450
The goal was to see who
could take it out first.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.710
But you were nice enough to wait for us?

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:35.120
So what, you can't beat it
on your own, you think,

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.820
and you want our help?

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:38.190
Not at all!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:40.870
Of course, I'll win our competition.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:44.890
But I can't have you interrupting my battle.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:48.060
It's me you're after, right?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.370
I'll fight you right here. Right now.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.700
Boss, he knows about us!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.620
I don't know why you'd
come alone if you knew.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.970
Did the guild hire you?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.150
Or are you after the bounty on these two?

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.490
That explains the high Concealment rank!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.750
Are you a bounty hunter
pretending to be a rookie?

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.160
<i>Bounty?</i>

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.420
<i>They've got a bounty on them?</i>

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.710
<i>That changes nothing.</i>

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:17.720
Right, right. You're right.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.890
Nah, just good luck on my part.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.890
You're the ones who approached
me first, right?

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:27.940
You, the big, wimpy one!
Come get me!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.080
Who are you calling wimpy?

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.430
Don't lie, mage!

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:34.190
Raj, don't let him provoke you!

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.480
What did you do?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:44.660
Rank D Green Magic: Mud Vine.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.230
<i>It turns the ground beneath my enemy
into a bottomless, muddy swamp,</i>

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:51.920
<i>binding them in place.</i>

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.400
<i>That's not all..</i>

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.170
<i>He's using the Concealment skill!</i>

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:01.070
Mud Vine takes time to activate.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.860
He set it in place early,
and hid it with Concealment?

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.180
My Detect Concealment couldn't detect it!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:12.320
Damn! My muscles can't
be stopped by some mud!

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.420
Wind!

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.140
Sorry, I'm out!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.540
Don't you dare run!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.910
There's something real bad about that rookie!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.770
My instincts are telling me that!

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:34.160
<i>My Lord, Gimul has fled.
Cashel will be here in a few seconds.</i>

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.110
Yeah, I know.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:37.700
All part of the plan.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:40.260
Come forth, Clotho. Don't let him escape!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:50.290
Clotho has evolved from a
Blue Slime to a Slime Gluttonia.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.600
<b>Slime Gluttonia</b>

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.590
His title is "Devourer."

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.440
What the hell is this slime?!

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.020
I've never seen anything like it!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.370
<b>A
few
days
ago</b>

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:13.860
That's enough for today, I guess.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.500
What's wrong?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.970
Don't tell me you took damage in that fight?

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.920
<i>No, My Lord!</i>

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.220
<i>Clotho is evolving!</i>

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:39.730
<b>Slime Gluttonia</b>

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:30.060
<i>A Slime Gluttonia.</i>

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:34.200
<i>A legendary quasi-demon-king-class monster</i>

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.330
<i>that almost destroyed the
Water Country of Toraj!</i>

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.400
<i>A Slime Gluttonia.</i>

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.700
You're awesome, Clotho.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:55.040
<b>Name: Gimul
Level: 27 Title: Death Bandit
HP 13/92
MP 28/36
Age: 19 | Strength 84
Race: Human | Endurance 81
Sex: Male | Agility 132
Class: Thief | Magic 30
Luck 29</b>

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:55.040
<b>Skills:
Throwing (Rank E)
Appraising Eye (Rank C)
Detect Concealment (Rank C)
Assist Effects:
Concealment (Rank F)</b>

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:56.350
I guess that's what an
Endurance of 81 gets you.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.990
Dokirekken!

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:05.770
Cashel, I'll handle this slime!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.850
I'll take you down, at least!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:16.350
Let's see what you can teach me, Cashel!

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:23.060
He's too strong...

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.290
So you wanted EXP to level up fast,

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:31.020
and to get it you were hunting new
adventurers instead of monsters?

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.420
That's pretty evil.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:35.980
I'm handing you over to the guild later.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:38.950
<i>Warm-up exercises are now down!</i>

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:42.510
<i>Time for the main event?</i>

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:48.410
Time to finally meet the
Blackghost Knight everyone's talking about.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:58.870
Level 53, and named, too.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:14:00.150
<b>Name: Gerard
Level: 53 Title: Patriot Guardian
HP 647/647
MP 162/162
Age: 138 | Strength 478
Race: Blackghost Knight Captain | Endurance 490
Sex: Male | Agility 163
Class: Dark Knight | Magic 112
Luck 97</b>

00:13:55.390 --> 00:14:00.150
<b>Skills:
Loyalty (Innate Skill)
Swordsmanship (Rank A)
Strength (Rank B)
Unbreakable Wall (rank B)
Mind's Eye (Rank C)
Military Leadership (Rank B)
50% Dark Damage Resist</b>

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:02.160
I would love to have you in my party!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:04.850
<i>You don't seem very nervous.</i>

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.460
What do you want?

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:13.320
I've come to defeat you, or I had.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.040
But I changed my mind.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.960
I'm Kelvin the summoner!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.600
I want to make a contract with you!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:28.050
<b>Name: Gerard
Level: 53 Title: Patriot Guardian
HP 647/647
MP 162/162
Age: 138 | Strength 478
Race: Blackghost Knight Captain | Endurance 490
Sex: Male | Agility 163
Class: Dark Knight | Magic 112
Luck 97
Skills:
Loyalty (Innate Skill) | Swordsmanship (Rank A)
Strength (Rank B) | Unbreakable Wall (rank B)
Mind's Eye (Rank C) | Military Leadership (Rank B)
50% Dark Damage Resist</b>

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:28.050
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:36.500
Lately, most people just run at
me with a sword when they see me.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:40.980
You're the first one to actually talk to me.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:45.360
I only became a monster with a
personality a short while ago.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:50.620
I used to be a Knight Captain,
serving my country.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.780
Human, you see.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.260
Why I became a monster...

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.450
I couldn't tell you.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:02.630
Maybe I had some unfinished
business in this world?

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.630
<b>Gluttonia can change their size.</b>

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:04.960
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:08.450
<i>Is he just a friendly old guy who likes to talk?</i>

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.960
What that unfinished business
could be, I can't say.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:14.850
But I've been protecting this castle.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.680
Oh, want some candy?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.340
S-Sure.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:21.690
<i>I can't believe the
Blackghost Knight is like this.</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.990
<i>He's happy to have someone
to finally talk to!</i>

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.350
<i>I can kind of understand that!</i>

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.260
What is this candy? It tastes weird!

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:35.270
I don't know how old it is,
but I didn't expect you to actually eat it.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:38.510
Even I'm, like, creeped out!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.130
Okay, old man, let's take this outside!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:50.940
<i>My Lord! The contract! The contract!</i>

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.420
Oh, right.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.390
So, will you make a contract with me?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.990
A contract?

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:02.980
The king and country I
served no longer exist.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.890
I'm willing to serve a new king, but...

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:10.700
You want to see what I can do, right?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.810
Sure, I'm down for that.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.730
In exchange, give me your all.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:18.310
Or there's no point!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.720
You're picking a fight with
me, when I'm stronger?

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:24.370
Kid, you really do interest me.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.980
Let's go, old man!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.650
I have a name, kid! It's Gerard!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.920
And my name isn't "kid," it's Kelvin!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.120
Wind Shot!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.220
Clotho!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.850
He stopped all of Clotho's
attacks from his blind spots?

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.200
<i>My Lord, Gerard has Mind's Eye!</i>

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:52.480
<i>He gets a bonus to any decisions
that require instant reactions!</i>

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:56.480
Give me your all, kid. Or there's no point!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.110
Earthen Rampart!

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.490
Self-destruct?

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:04.710
That slime's got all kinds of tricks!

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.470
<i>Jump as far as you can to the side!</i>

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.870
Agito!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.590
Crap, I couldn't even see his blade move!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:13.720
Cleft Chasm!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.440
Even that unsteady ground
doesn't slow him down at all?

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.790
Amazing! Really...

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:28.700
But...

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.270
Air Pressure!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.020
What's this?

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:36.670
A spell that uses air pressure
to lock you in place!

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.530
Don't get yourself killed, old man!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:42.930
I-I can't die here...

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.110
<i>My love...</i>

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.420
I-I remember.

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:54.450
<i>Alcarl, a country of many
farms and much greenery.</i>

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.140
<i>Small, but it was my home.</i>

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:03.740
<i>One day, a messenger from the western
continent, an elf named Jildora, came.</i>

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:07.490
King Alcarl, serve my
nation, the Lizea Empire,

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:12.200
and destroy the Holy Empire of Deramis.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.890
Do you mock us?

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:18.560
<i>Of course, the king refused his demands.</i>

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:21.140
<i>But the elf said...</i>

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.870
Do not forget, wise king.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:31.050
If you refuse to obey Lizea,
you will pay a price.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:41.720
Connie, our daughter...

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:46.710
Betty...

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:58.770
<i>In but a few days, Alcarl fell.</i>

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:05.730
You served me with loyalty. Now rest.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.840
I hit my limits long ago.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.570
Now what do we do?

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:19.440
I know... How about a piece of candy?

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.790
What do you think, Connie?

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:30.070
Avenging this nation, Alcarl!

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.700
That is what keeps me in this world!

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.030
<i>You're kidding me...</i>

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.190
<i>He knocked away the Air Pressure spell!</i>

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.660
Kid, can you...

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.160
Earthen Rampart!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.060
...help me get vengeance?

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:43.040
Air Pressure!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.520
Stop!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.960
Now, Clotho!

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:52.100
Let 'er rip!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.050
<i>Connie... Betty... I...</i>

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.810
<b>The
next
day</b>

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:12.520
This is indeed a fragment of
the Blackghost Knight's armor.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:14.740
Job complete!

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:17.690
Wow, rookie!

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.590
You beat the Blackghost Knight
everybody said was dangerous?

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:24.330
We were so sick of Cashel and his gang!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.710
Thanks to you, we're rid of them!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.360
You're going to confess to all
the other crimes you committed.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.790
Expect the death penalty.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.600
Kelvin!

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:49.460
Your last job was designated
as far surpassing Rank D.

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.850
Thus, you'll be given a special rank increase

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.050
and a personal thanks from
the head of the guild!

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:57.870
I'm glad you're safe...

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:01.820
You really are full of surprises.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:05.270
Yeah, I'm surprised, too.

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:09.240
That Blackghost Knight was really strong.

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:15.870
<i>The girl at the front desk was a beauty.</i>

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.740
<i>Think she's a candidate
for your harem, my king?</i>

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.320
<i>Wait!</i>

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.980
<i>I'm your fiancГ©e!</i>

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:27.160
<i>Oh, you're not to be
underestimated then, my king.</i>

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:35.940
<b>Kelvin's Servants  Open Slots: 7
Melfina: Unknown
Clotho: Slime Gluttonia Lv. 15
Gerard: Dark Knight Lv. 53</b>

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.160
<i>You already had a fiancГ©e, huh?</i>

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.750
<i>That's right!</i>

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:35.930
Stop talking inside my head!

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:40.310
Gerard, I told you to stop calling me
a kid, but "my king" isn't any better!

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:43.950
A knight can only serve a king!

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:45.030
And you're not my fiancГ©e, Melfina.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:45.940
Be honest.

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.640
You're just using me as an excuse
to skip out on your job as a goddess.

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:50.630
<i>Well...</i>

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.080
<i>My Lord, look in front of you!</i>

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.710
<i>There's someone there!</i>

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.130
Don't change the subject!

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:08.480
It's certainly a beautiful day today.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:10.050
<b>EP 02: Dark Knight</b>
